    <content contentuid="h01e011c8g5727g5aacg91b9g82472613730c" version="1">Taixuan</content>
    <content contentuid="h02051974gdbceg5b15gb6dag01f1449c0f8a" version="1">心照万法，剑通天地。凝气为锋，洞悉破绽，在从容护身与精准反击之间施展超然剑术。</content>
    <content contentuid="h022de9dfg4fa7g5281ga2f6g65f98170fad9" version="1">Requires at least 7 Frenzy stacks.</content>
    <content contentuid="h02937807gec67g57a8gbcd0g1b29ebfdec16" version="1">跟进机会</content>
