    <content contentuid="h094b000fg6873g5173g8abbg4d8138433f4f" version="1">星河反击</content>
    <content contentuid="h097c08a3gc9a7g525cgb80fge202bc0f0e5d" version="1">血影穿身 · 副手佩剑</content>
    <content contentuid="h0aee23aag0905g50c7gaa0agcc0ee00db3af" version="1">掠血 · 御剑主手</content>
    <content contentuid="h0e51667ega944g5957ga6b4g47f5f0270c2e" version="1">天锋破阵 · 副手佩剑</content>
    <content contentuid="h10809911g92b8g5c85g9d50gea9ea379793a" version="1">收束心神，运转剑元，为下一剑积蓄力量。&lt;br&gt;战斗中使用一次出剑机会，不耗剑元，恢复剑元容量40%，向上取整。&lt;br&gt;太玄11级起主动调息恢复50%。&lt;br&gt;战后调息可回满剑元。</content>
    <content contentuid="h11dd84b4gd668g565fgb3a9gbdee83565a76" version="1">天崩剑啸</content>
    <content contentuid="h12afa06fg61cfg59acg88fdgb9758f59059b" version="1">历经红尘，仍愿同行。以灵动剑术接应同伴，以合击与御剑呼应共同破敌；危难时承接伤势，与众人走出风雨。</content>
    <content contentuid="h1364a51agb104g5da1gb442gb937d6b46e2b" version="1">剑心／感知御剑</content>
    <content contentuid="h14cc8df0g6cceg5033g9a0fga79d11dc80b5" version="1">无视敌人的借机攻击。</content>
    <content contentuid="h14f42247g8674g5c1fg9b3ega184478b49ef" version="1">Xueyan</content>
    <content contentuid="h151825ccg9aa6g53f1g82edg594392860222" version="1">附赠动作，6剑元，为自己或18米内一名实际队友恢复目标最大生命30%；实际治疗同伴奖励协作回气。3级初阶为4元恢复15%。</content>
    <content contentuid="h15f8392eg5395g5b99g9657g88f81bb83472" version="1">以清辉护体，化解来袭攻势并将剑光返照于敌。附赠动作，4剑元，持续2轮；护甲等级额外＋3、减伤30%。攻势落空或被剑气减伤时，可向18米内攻击者反击，额外命中＋2，造成2d6＋感知＋4d8力场伤害。符合条件的独立攻击阶段均可提供反击机会；反击不耗反应、剑元或出剑机会。</content>
    <content contentuid="h165eacc2g526bg599eg81e4g960af8c57a8d" version="1">剑气护体</content>
    <content contentuid="h16c49002g7b76g51bbg8fd3g452f740a73e0" version="1">血魇·无生 · 投入8层癫狂</content>
    <content contentuid="h170d134bg6f78g5bbdg86fcg818e1071d17a" version="1">Requires Sword Flight.</content>
    <content contentuid="h184c4e59gac44g5f48gad99g3d60077a5445" version="1">对已覆盖身体与心智控制的抵抗获得优势并额外+4。</content>
